        {
          "@type": "oa:TextQuoteSelector",
          "oa:exact": "(3) If the Secretary determines that a manufacturer’s remedy program is not likely to be capable of completion within a reasonable time, the Secretary may require the manufacturer to accelerate the remedy program if the Secretary finds—"
